<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11910] JDBC v2: adds &apos;schema&apos; to URL parameters, makes &apos;cache&apos; parameter is optional for the most cases</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11910</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have to do changes for the JDBC v2:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;makes &apos;cache&apos; parameter is optional.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;add &apos;schema&apos; parameter to URL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;When cache and schema parameters are not defined &apos;PUBLIC&apos; schema is used.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
